#: lib/tuist_web/plugs/api/authorization/billing_plug.ex:128
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A payment for the subscription of the account '%{account}' failed, so the account is limited to the free tier of the 'Tuist Air' plan, which it has used up. Update the payment method and pay the open invoice at %{url} to restore access."
msgstr "帳戶「%{account}」的訂閱付款失敗，因此該帳戶已限於使用已耗盡的「Tuist Air」方案免費層級。請在 %{url} 更新付款方式並支付未結發票，以恢復存取權限。"

#: lib/tuist_web/live/billing_live.html.heex:11
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A payment for your subscription failed"
msgstr "您的訂閱付款失敗"

#: lib/tuist/accounts/user_notifier.ex:562
#: lib/tuist/accounts/user_notifier.ex:600
#: lib/tuist_web/live/billing_live.html.heex:28
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Pay open invoice"
msgstr "支付未結發票"

#: lib/tuist_web/live/billing_live.html.heex:19
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Your plan is limited to the free tier of the Air plan until the open invoice is paid."
msgstr "在支付未結發票之前，您的方案將限制為 Air 方案的免費層級。"

#: lib/tuist_web/live/billing_live.html.heex:14
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Your plan stays active while the payment is retried. Pay the open invoice or update your payment method to keep it."
msgstr "在重試付款期間，您的方案會保持活躍。請支付未結發票或更新付款方式以維持服務。"

#: lib/tuist/accounts/user_notifier.ex:543
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A payment for the Tuist subscription of %{account_name} failed"
msgstr "%{account_name} 的 Tuist 訂閱付款失敗"

#: lib/tuist/accounts/user_notifier.ex:560
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Pay the open invoice or update your payment method to keep your plan:"
msgstr "請支付未結發票或更新付款方式以維持您的方案："

#: lib/tuist/accounts/user_notifier.ex:550
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "We couldn't charge the payment method on file for the subscription of %{account_name}. The payment is retried automatically."
msgstr "我們無法對 %{account_name} 訂閱的現有付款方式進行扣款。系統會自動重試付款。"

#: lib/tuist/accounts/user_notifier.ex:548
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Your subscription payment failed"
msgstr "您的訂閱付款失敗"

#: lib/tuist/accounts/user_notifier.ex:555
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Your plan stays active while the payment is retried. If it still hasn't gone through when the retries end, %{account_name} is limited to the free tier of the Air plan until the invoice is paid."
msgstr "在重試付款期間，您的方案會保持活躍。如果重試結束後付款仍未成功，%{account_name} 將限制為 Air 方案的免費層級，直到發票付清為止。"

#: lib/tuist/accounts/user_notifier.ex:582
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "%{account_name} moved to the Air plan because its subscription payment failed"
msgstr "由於訂閱付款失敗，%{account_name} 已轉至 Air 方案"

#: lib/tuist/accounts/user_notifier.ex:594
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Paying the open invoice restores your plan. You can also update your payment method before paying:"
msgstr "支付未結發票即可恢復您的方案。您也可以在付款前更新付款方式："

#: lib/tuist/accounts/user_notifier.ex:589
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "We couldn't collect the payment for the subscription of %{account_name}, and the retries have ended. %{account_name} is now limited to the free tier of the Air plan."
msgstr "我們無法收取 %{account_name} 的訂閱費用，且重試已結束。%{account_name} 現時僅可使用 Air 方案的免費層級。"

#: lib/tuist/accounts/user_notifier.ex:587
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Your account moved to the Air plan"
msgstr "您的帳戶已轉至 Air 方案"